 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** The polynomial evaluation and bisection are constant time per cell, $O(1)$. The bisection is fixed to a small number of iterations (e.g., 3) [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ auxiliary memory per ray-cell intersection.
